{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>A man shall not take his father's wife.</b> The verse speaks of his father's violated woman (אנוסת אביו), and therefore Scripture attached this verse to the passage of the violated woman (אנוסה)." "<b>And he shall not uncover his father's skirt.</b> The verse speaks of his father's yevamah who is awaiting levirate marriage (שומרת יבם)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:50:28.169009297Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}